  data: {
    LLM: "As a bettor, manage your bankroll. Since the Banker has a statistical edge (winning on ties), avoid max-betting on every hand.\n\nThe 'Switch' Strategem: In social games where the Banker role is optional, only accept the role if you have a sufficient bankroll to cover multiple 'Kiu' double-payouts.\n\nStatistical Tracking: In a 28-tile game with 8 players, 16 tiles are in play. If you have seen many high tiles such as 6-6 and 5-6 in previous rounds and the deck is not shuffled every turn, the probability of low hands increases.",
    Player: "As a bettor, manage your bankroll. Since the Banker has a statistical edge (winning on ties), avoid max-betting on every hand.\n\nThe 'Switch' Strategem: In social games where the Banker role is optional, only accept the role if you have a sufficient bankroll to cover multiple 'Kiu' double-payouts.\n\nStatistical Tracking: In a 28-tile game with 8 players, 16 tiles are in play. If you have seen many high tiles such as 6-6 and 5-6 in previous rounds and the deck is not shuffled every turn, the probability of low hands increases.",
